  {
   "text": "Two Innistrad: Midnight Hunt Commander decks were released together with Innistrad: Midnight Hunt . These are meant to be on-ramps to Commander , with a few new cards and the rest reprints .",
   "scene": 0,
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "There are 30 new cards (with printed set code MIC and collector numbers #1/38 to #30/38) printed in the Innistrad: Midnight Hunt Commander Decks. These cards are legal for play in the Commander , Vintage , and Legacy formats. They aren't legal for play in the Standard , Pioneer , or Modern formats. Eight additional cards with the MIC code (#31/38 to #38/38) can only be found in the Set and Collector Boosters. MIC #39-76 are extended-art versions of the previous cards. The other cards in these decks (with printed set code MIC and collector numbers #077-187) are legal for play in any format that already allows those cards; that is, appearing in these decks doesn't change a card's legality in any format.",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Description"
  },
  {
   "text": "The new cards are themed to the world and the reprints can be from anywhere. Angel of Glory's Rise is the only reprint with new art.",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Description"
  },
  {
   "text": "Each package contains:",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "1 Display Commander card",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "2 foil Legendary cards",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "10 double-sided tokens",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "Eight additional cards with the MIC code (#31/38 to #38/38) can only be found in the Set and Collector Boosters. They aren't found in the Innistrad: Midnight Hunt Commander decks. Five of these form the Visions cycle, while a sixth rare completes the Curses \"cycle\" of the main set.",
   "scene": 3,
   "section": "Cycles and additional cards"
  },
  {
   "text": "The last two additional cards are both mythic: Avacyn's Memorial and Lynde, Cheerful Tormentor .",
   "scene": 3,
   "section": "Cycles and additional cards"
  },
